(63,'en','Gothic Voices','Medieval music · United Kingdom','The British ensemble Gothic Voices, founded in 1980 by Christopher Page, in a refined performance of medieval music. Catherine King (mezzo-soprano), Steven Harrold and Julian Podger (tenors) and Simon Whiteley (baritone).','',NULL),
