(64,'en','EU Evening: “The Last Rose of Summer”','David Tobin, Finghin Collins, Johanna Kezei','The European Union evening brought the programme “The Last Rose of Summer” with Irish violinist David Tobin, Irish pianist Finghin Collins and Hungarian-Irish flautist Johanna Kezei.','E. Elgar — Violin Sonata in E minor, Op. 82
