(70,'en','OH, JAZZ: National Jazz Orchestra and Peter Somuah','Jazz evening at Dolni Saraj','The National Jazz Orchestra of North Macedonia led by Vladimir Nikolov, with special guest trumpeter Peter Somuah, born in Ghana and based in the Netherlands.','','Vladimir Nikolov'),
